  "title": "Mint Buttercream Frosting With Dark Chocolate Glaze",
  "description": "This mint frosting recipe made with confectioners' sugar, mint extract, and unsweetened chocolate is a good frosting for mayonnaise cake. Delicious!",
  "authors": [
